 that structural costs or income inadequacy are imaginary.""], ""ending_words"": ""The people who feel rich are the ones who consciously resist lifestyle inflation, who understand their geographic advantage or disadvantage, who've paid off their debts or are managing them strategically, who aren't comparing themselves to everyone on social media who understand what their money is doing and where it's going. that they feel rich because they're rich relative to their spending, not relative to their income. And that distinction changes everything about how they experience their financial life."", ""opening_words"": ""Have you ever hit a major financial milestone and then felt absolutely nothing? Like you thought reaching six figures was going to be this transformative moment where you'd finally feel wealthy and instead you're still checking your bank account with the same anxiety you had when you were making half that."", ""review_scope"": ""FULL_STORED_TEXT"", ""source"": {""Caption_type"": ""auto_generated"", ""Dataset"": ""DS-000022"", ""Duplicate_of"": """", ""Evidence_locator"": ""data/extracted/channel-data/DS-000022/packages/nick-invests/NickInvests_Transcripts_363_Videos.zip::290_S0xwBH_fAn0_Why_100K_Doesnt_Feel_Rich_Anymore.txt"", ""Human_verified"": ""NO"", ""Status"": ""TEXT_AVAILABLE"", ""Text_SHA256"": ""63fb4984aeaf2b7cc3f80a6747cbbf1f28b17f0a141f7ea68a6732c9c28907b4"", ""Timing"": ""PLAINTEXT_NO_TIMED_SEGMENTS_EXTRACTED"", ""Video_ID"": ""S0xwBH_fAn0"", ""Words"": ""3240""}, ""source_refs"": [""VIDEO_MASTER.csv:S0xwBH_fAn0"", ""TRANSCRIPT_COVERAGE.csv:S0xwBH_fAn0"", ""audit-batches/NICK_158_READ_RECEIPTS.json""], ""stored_text_completeness"": ""FULL_AVAILABLE_STORED_TEXT_READ_HASH_VERIFIED; auto-generated captions; original audio, timed delivery and editing unverified"", ""timing"": ""OPENING_WORDS_ONLY""}","{""analysis"": ""The exact topic is the gap between the cultural six-figure milestone and experienced financial security, combining after-tax cash f